  id: spell-scorching-ray
  displayName: Scorching Ray
  description: You create three rays of fire and hurl them at targets within range, one at a time or several. Make a ranged spell attack for each ray; on a hit, the target takes 2d6 fire damage. Modeled as up to 3 targets, each taking one attack-roll-gated 2d6 hit -- like Magic Missile, stacking multiple rays onto one target isn't modeled.
